    "version": "v2-daily-rewards-7d-r2",
    "notes": "7-day weekly daily-login ladder. Player-anchored (each player runs their own 7 slots from their first claim) and loops back to slot 1 after slot 7. Day boundary is a fixed UTC rollover computed server-side, so device clock/timezone changes have no effect. graceDays=1 forgives a single missed day; two or more consecutive missed days reset the ladder to slot 1. Currency rewards (coins/gems) carry no skuId - they credit Economy/Stats directly. Item/crate rewards must reference a real skuId from ItemSkusCatalog. BALANCE (r2): weighted toward utility items (speed-ups/boosters) that drive the V2 timer loops, light on raw gems which cannibalise the shop. Perfect week pays ~451 gems of hard value plus 4,000 coins. Day 7 is ~50% of the week's value so the milestone is worth chasing. Do not use Shards SKUs here - they are category 'currency' with metadata.currency 'spellShards' and would land as inert inventory docs rather than crediting the shard balance.",
